---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<Page title="Delete your account" heading="Delete your account" description="How to delete your Folio account and your data, in the app, on the web or by email."
  lede="You can delete your account and everything we store at any time.">
  <h2>In the iPhone app</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open Folio and go to <strong>Profile</strong>.</li>
    <li>Tap <strong>Account</strong>, then <strong>Delete account</strong>.</li>
    <li>Confirm who you are (Apple, Google or an email code), type <code>DELETE</code> and confirm.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Your account and every entry, photo and task on our servers is deleted straight away; server clean-up finishes within minutes, and backups within 30 days. Folio then asks whether to keep a copy of your diary on the iPhone.</p>

  <h2>On the web</h2>
  <p>Sign in at <a href="/app">folio.devilsense.com/app</a> and go to Profile → Delete account (or open <a href="/app/settings/account">folio.devilsense.com/app/settings/account</a>). You don’t need to unlock your diary first.</p>

  <h2>By email</h2>
  <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.privacyEmail}?subject=Delete%20my%20Folio%20account`}>{site.privacyEmail}</a> from the address you signed in with. We’ll confirm before deleting.</p>

  <h2>No account?</h2>
  <p>Then we hold nothing about you. To clear the app, go to Profile → Your data → <strong>Erase data on this iPhone</strong>. That removes every entry, photo, task and category, including Recently Deleted.</p>
</Page>
